```Same baseline on Palo Alto URL logs (Splunk Add-on for Palo Alto Networks). URL logs are THREAT logs with log_subtype=url; eventtype pan_url selects them.```
eventtype=pan_url earliest=-14d
| eval dest_host=coalesce(dest_name, url_domain, dest)
| stats count AS events dc(user) AS users
        sum(eval(if(action IN ("blocked","block-url","deny"),1,0))) AS denies
        values(category) AS category values(rule) AS rules BY dest_host
| sort - events
